            <customized-tooltip show-buttons='false'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Boroughs with advanced processing hubs, such as Southwark, process high volumes of complex residual waste. These facilities separate mixed rubbish, dry out organic material, and extract recyclables. In official local authority waste reporting, these operations are historically categorized under landfill-related disposal streams. Because the waste passes through Southwark&apos;s central facility, the resulting tonnage is recorded directly on Southwark&apos;s balance sheet.</run>
