            <body x='137' y='30' />
          </annotation>
          <annotation class='point' id='4' mark-position='1' pullback='0' text-width='328'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize='11'>Over the past four years, existing facilities have operated at their maximum capacity, driving the development of new infrastructure projects like the Edmonton EcoPark redevelopment in Enfield; this is why the last years the amount of tonnes difference, comparing with 2015/16 are similar. </run>
            </formatted-text>
            <point>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord axis-value='233200.24720452522'>
                  <node-reference>
                    <axis>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[usr:Calculation_0404119769726976:qk:1]</axis>
                  </node-reference>
                </x-coord>
                <y-coord cell-offset='0.37758'>
                  <node-reference>
                    <fields>
                      <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:Calculation_1222966693089281:nk]</field>
                      <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:facility_type:nk]</field>
                    </fields>
                    <multibucket>
