        <annotations>
          <annotation class='point' id='4' mark-position='1' pullback='0' text-width='367'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Waste sent to landfill continues to decline due to rising landfill tax rates and a lack of available land within Greater London. This tonnage includes waste landfilled both inside and outside Greater London.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <point>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord cell-offset='0.514124'>
                  <node-reference>
                    <fields>
                      <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:Calculation_1222966693089281:nk]</field>
                    </fields>
                    <multibucket>
                      <bucket>&quot;2024/25&quot;</bucket>
                    </multibucket>
                  </node-reference>
                </x-coord>
                <y-coord axis-value='1543.870291075734'>
                  <node-reference>
                    <axis>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[sum:total_tonnes:qk]</axis>
                  </node-reference>
                </y-coord>
                <page-reference />
              </visual-coordinate>
            </point>
            <body x='-206' y='-138' />
          </annotation>
          <annotation class='point' id='9' mark-position='1' pullback='0' text-width='293'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Because recycling and reuse rates have stagnated over the last decade, the volume of waste sent to incineration has increased. This includes residual waste burned both inside and outside Greater London.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <point>
              <visual-coordinate class='mark'>
                <tuple-reference>
                  <tuple-descriptor>
                    <pane-descriptor>
                      <x-fields>
                        <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:Calculation_1222966693089281:nk]</field>
                      </x-fields>
                      <y-fields>
                        <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[sum:total_tonnes:qk]</field>
                      </y-fields>
                    </pane-descriptor>
                    <columns>
                      <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:Calculation_0678433199697920:nk]</field>
                      <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:Calculation_1222966693089281:nk]</field>
                      <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:treatment_group:nk]</field>
                      <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[sum:total_tonnes:qk]</field>
                    </columns>
                  </tuple-descriptor>
                  <tuple>
                    <value>&quot;Incineration&quot;</value>
                    <value>&quot;2024/25&quot;</value>
                    <value>&quot;Incineration&quot;</value>
                    <value>749344.8846444115</value>
                  </tuple>
                </tuple-reference>
              </visual-coordinate>
            </point>
            <body x='-112' y='128' />
          </annotation>
          <annotation class='point' id='11' mark-position='1' pullback='12' text-width='294'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Despite expectations that the pandemic online shopping boom would cause packaging waste to increase, actual tonnage </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>rose slightly 0.06%</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> during COVID-19.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <point>
              <visual-coordinate class='mark'>
                <tuple-reference>
                  <tuple-descriptor>
                    <pane-descriptor>
                      <x-fields>
                        <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[none:Calculation_1222966693089281:nk]</field>
                      </x-fields>
                      <y-fields>
                        <field>[federated.1s9f3fk04vwlwq14q6lzw0c9zduq].[sum:total_tonnes:qk]</field>
                      </y-fields>
                    </pane-descriptor>
                    <columns>
