                  </tuple>
                </tuple-reference>
              </visual-coordinate>
            </point>
            <body x='-174' y='149' />
          </annotation>
          <annotation class='point' id='12' mark-position='1' pullback='12' text-width='279'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Despite the disruptions caused by the pandemic, London remained committed to reducing the volume of residual waste sent to landfill.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <point>
              <visual-coordinate class='mark'>
                <tuple-reference>
                  <tuple-descriptor>
