            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Westminster and the City of London generate the highest per-capita incineration tonnage in London; since these are very commercial and tourist-heavy areas, their waste generation is significantly higher.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <point>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord axis-value='-19609.002044621979'>
