              </visual-coordinate>
            </point>
            <body x='-203' y='208' />
          </annotation>
          <annotation class='point' id='1' mark-position='1' pullback='0' text-width='188'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>The way the data is recorded, bring me to suspect that the waste is carried from other London boroughs to areas which have an incinerator, like Lewisham.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <point>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord axis-value='-1610.2142178176437'>
                  <node-reference>
