                    <zone fixed-size='386' h='14235' id='206' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='28258' x='71742' y='29181'>
                      <zone fixed-size='284' forceUpdate='true' h='6738' id='72' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='28258' x='71742' y='29181'>
                        <formatted-text>
                          <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>    The introduction of the UK Landfill Tax in 1996 drove a significant shift away from landfill disposal. While recycling, reuse, and composting initiatives were designed to capture this diverted waste, recycling rates have plateaued. </run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                          <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>    Consequently, incineration has become the central route for managing London&apos;s remaining residual waste stream.</run>
                        </formatted-text>
                        <zone-style>
                          <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                          <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                          <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                          <format attr='margin' value='5' />
                          <format attr='margin-top' value='0' />
                          <format attr='margin-bottom' value='0' />
