                <zone fixed-size='86' forceUpdate='true' h='2230' id='397' type-v2='text' w='45022' x='54978' y='54402'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='12'>    Despite the energy recovery (EfW) benefits delivered by modern incinerators, local communities and environmental groups continue to raise concerns regarding health risks and air pollution.</run>
