                <zone fixed-size='452' forceUpdate='true' h='9467' id='203' type-v2='text' w='38507' x='0' y='62633'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='16'>Incineration waste per capita</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='12'>    London&apos;s  two of its primary incinerators with EfW facilities are located in South East London, not only facility location tells the whole story about each London borough waste tonnage; waste volumes also depend on housing density, as large populations living in high-density flats comparing with house areas.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='497' forceUpdate='true' h='11791' id='166' type-v2='text' w='40702' x='0' y='73286'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='12'>Incineration is divided into two main routes:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='12'>Æ          </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>with energy recovery </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>(with EfW)</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>Æ   </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>without energy recovery </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>(without EfW)</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>    Incineration with EfW processed waste tonnes keeps increasing. Although incineration without EfW increased the last ten years, it keeps dropping in tonnage. London and the UK still focussed on improving recycling/reusing treatment routes, but meantime, it looks like incineration with EfW will play an important part on residual waste management.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>More information:</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
