                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='1088' forceUpdate='true' h='3986' id='303' type-v2='text' w='79648' x='20352' y='87521'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='16'>What future is waiting to incineration with EfW</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>    As London (and the UK) gradually reduced reliance on traditional landfilling, incineration with EfW stepped in to process non-recycled waste. With local recycling rates stagnating due to contamination and plastic packaging constraints, London is turning to more efficient, high-capacity EfW technology. While waste generation has remained stable in recent years, phasing out landfills makes these facilities vital for regional self-sufficiency, following successful models in land-restricted countries like Japan and Singapore.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='759' id='489' is-fixed='true' name='ArticleSingapore' show-title='false' w='79648' x='20352' y='91507'>
                  <layout-cache fixed-size-h='28' fixed-size-w='406' type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='792' forceUpdate='true' h='6643' id='310' type-v2='text' w='58566' x='0' y='92740'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Technology used for Scripts/Data Storage </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>MysqL Server</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> with ETL (Extract Transform and Load) queries </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Version Control with </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Github</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> : I created a repository to store all my </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>SQL scripts</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> and </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Tableau Project</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>  + Feel free to visit my </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>repository</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>: </run>
                    <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#000000' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://github.com/ddgg37/PlasticRecyclingProjectV2&amp;quot;'>https://github.com/ddgg37/PlasticRecyclingProjectV2</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='176' forceUpdate='true' h='3417' id='311' type-v2='text' w='41434' x='58566' y='92740'>
